      "text": "## Cohort-Component Model — Full Specification"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-POPULATION-PROJECTIONS.md#004",
      "path": [
        "08-POPULATION-PROJECTIONS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
