        "title": "Population Projections",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nCOHORT-COMPONENT METHOD:\n  The standard workhorse for population projection.\n  Projects population by age group and sex separately,\n  applying fertility rates to women of childbearing age\n  and survival rates to each cohort."
    },
    {
      "id": "08-POPULATION-PROJECTIONS.md#005",
      "path": [
        "08-POPULATION-PROJECTIONS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:demography:08-population-projections, git-history:demography:08-population-projections]",
        "canonical_path": "demography/08-POPULATION-PROJECTIONS.md",
        "concepts": "[population, projections]",
        "current_path": "demography/08-POPULATION-PROJECTIONS.md",
        "id": "maxim:demography:population-projections",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "demography",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[population, projections]",
        "section": "demography",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Population Projections",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "STEP-BY-STEP ALGORITHM:\n  Input: N(x, s, t) = population in age group x, sex s, at time t"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-POPULATION-PROJECTIONS.md#006",
      "path": [
        "08-POPULATION-PROJECTIONS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:demography:08-population-projections, git-history:demography:08-population-projections]",
        "canonical_path": "demography/08-POPULATION-PROJECTIONS.md",
        "concepts": "[population, projections]",
        "current_path": "demography/08-POPULATION-PROJECTIONS.md",
        "id": "maxim:demography:population-projections",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "demography",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[population, projections]",
        "section": "demography",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Population Projections",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "1. SURVIVAL (advance all cohorts one time period):\n     N(x+n, s, t+n) = N(x, s, t) × sSₓ(t)\n     where sSₓ = survival ratio = nLx+n / nLx (from life table)\n     For oldest age group (open interval): survival + new entrants"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-POPULATION-PROJECTIONS.md#007",
      "path": [
        "08-POPULATION-PROJECTIONS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:demography:08-population-projections, git-history:demography:08-population-projections]",
        "canonical_path": "demography/08-POPULATION-PROJECTIONS.md",
        "concepts": "[population, projections]",
        "current_path": "demography/08-POPULATION-PROJECTIONS.md",
        "id": "maxim:demography:population-projections",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "demography",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[population, projections]",
        "section": "demography",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Population Projections",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "2. BIRTHS (generate new youngest cohort from fertility rates):\n     B(t) = Σₓ ASFR(x, t) × N(x, female, t) × n\n     (sum over 5-year age groups of reproductive-age women)"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-POPULATION-PROJECTIONS.md#008",
      "path": [
        "08-POPULATION-PROJECTIONS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:demography:08-population-projections, git-history:demography:08-population-projections]",
        "canonical_path": "demography/08-POPULATION-PROJECTIONS.md",
        "concepts": "[population, projections]",
        "current_path": "demography/08-POPULATION-PROJECTIONS.md",
        "id": "maxim:demography:population-projections",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "demography",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[population, projections]",
        "section": "demography",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Population Projections",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "3. SURVIVAL OF BIRTHS:\n     N(0-4, male, t+5) = B(t) × (1/(1+SRB)) × ₅L₀ / l₀ × 5\n     N(0-4, female, t+5) = B(t) × (SRB/(1+SRB)) × ₅L₀ / l₀ × 5\n     where SRB = sex ratio at birth (typically ~1.05 males per female)"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-POPULATION-PROJECTIONS.md#009",
      "path": [
        "08-POPULATION-PROJECTIONS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:demography:08-population-projections, git-history:demography:08-population-projections]",
        "canonical_path": "demography/08-POPULATION-PROJECTIONS.md",
        "concepts": "[population, projections]",
        "current_path": "demography/08-POPULATION-PROJECTIONS.md",
        "id": "maxim:demography:population-projections",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "demography",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[population, projections]",
        "section": "demography",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Population Projections",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "4. MIGRATION (add net migrants to appropriate age/sex groups):\n     N(x, s, t+n) += NM(x, s, t)\n     (Net migrants allocated by assumed age-sex distribution)"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-POPULATION-PROJECTIONS.md#010",
      "path": [
        "08-POPULATION-PROJECTIONS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
