      "text": "LESLIE MATRIX FORM (without migration):\n  n(t+n) = A × n(t)\n  where n is full age-sex vector, A is the age-sex projection matrix\n  (See 01-POPULATION-DYNAMICS for matrix structure)\n```"
    },
